# AI proxy (`functions/`)

See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

- Keep the local `PagesFunction` type (do not import Workers types that clash with DOM `Response`).
- Route by `task`: vision → Gemini Flash; text → Flash-Lite; on failure → Workers AI.
- Enforce per-IP rate limits and `maxTokens` caps server-side.
- Never expose `GEMINI_API_KEY` to the client.
